    "summary_one_sentence": "A former elite sniper living in secret on a remote Australian farm must fight for survival against a ruthless warlord to protect her young daughter.",
    "summary_short": "After escaping a traumatic past, a former elite sniper has built a quiet, hidden life raising her daughter on a secluded Australian farm. Her peaceful existence is shattered when the ruthless warlord who once held her captive tracks her down with deadly intent. To safeguard her child's future, she is forced to dust off her lethal skills and prepare for an all-out siege. What follows is a high-stakes struggle where motherly love meets absolute survival.",
    "summary_long": "Years after escaping captivity at the hands of a brutal warlord, a retired elite sniper has crafted a quiet, off-the-grid life on an isolated Australian farm to raise her daughter in safety. However, her tranquil life comes to a sudden halt when her former captor uncovers her location and dispatches a team to eliminate her. Recognizing the immediate threat to her child, the veteran sharpshooter transforms her expansive rural homestead into a fortress of defense and tactical traps. As the warlord's mercenaries surround the perimeter, she utilizes her mastery of stealth, ballistics, and terrain to systematically neutralize the invaders one by one. Each confrontation tests her physically and emotionally, forcing her to confront the psychological scars of her past while remaining focused on her child's security. Despite being heavily outnumbered and outgunned, her fierce maternal instinct fuels an unyielding resolve to survive. The tension culminates in a deadly, high-stakes final standoff against the warlord himself amidst the rugged wilderness. Ultimately, she proves that no force is more lethal than a mother protecting her child, securing her family's freedom once and for all.",
    "synopsis": "Set against the stark, isolated backdrop of the Australian countryside, this intense action-thriller follows a former elite sniper who has trade her combat boots for a peaceful life raising her daughter in hiding. Her sanctuary is disrupted when the ruthless warlord responsible for her past torment discovers her location, bringing a deadly confrontation directly to her doorstep. To protect her daughter's future, she must rely on her specialized military training, tactical genius, and intimate knowledge of the rugged terrain. As the siege unfolds, the narrative blends high-tension suspense with grounded drama, exploring themes of maternal devotion, survival, and overcoming past trauma in the face of insurmountable odds.",
